      "text": "Brownsburg was first settled in 1824 by James B. and later renamed from Harrisburgh to Brownsburg in 1836 to avoid confusion with another post office.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
